# FreeLFS upstream sources: one URL per line, '#' starts a comment.
# Edit this list, then run ./build/update-lock.sh to refresh sources.lock.
#
# Based on the LFS 13.1 package list, with these FreeLFS changes:
#   - linux 7.1.8 replaced by the current LTS kernel (6.18.x)
#   - grub dropped (we write flboot), lfs-bootscripts dropped (own rc scripts)
#   - dbus dropped from the base (comes back in M6)
#   - documentation tarballs dropped (python docs, sqlite docs, tcl html,
#     systemd man pages)
#   - systemd source kept only to build udev; sysvinit is our init

